WEBVTT

00:08.080 --> 00:14.500
Zhen still remembers... when I was merely a prince in Dong Province, we lived in a modest courtyard.

00:15.040 --> 00:19.800
It was far smaller than this imperial palace, yet in my heart, it felt boundlessly spacious.

00:20.000 --> 00:27.200
Your son remembers too. Eldest Brother and I were always tumbling and scuffling about, trampling Mother's blossoms—we took quite a few switchings from you for that!

00:30.400 --> 00:36.500
Your mother and I have both grown old. As years mount upon us, we can't help feeling wistful about the past.

00:41.200 --> 00:45.000
From now on, your son will visit the palace often to keep you and Imperial Mother company.

00:45.560 --> 00:51.000
You are a devoted, filial child... and so is your elder brother.

00:52.880 --> 01:01.600
(Not long ago, His Majesty craved fresh lychees from Qing Province and decreed a grand canal be dug between the capital and the south.)

01:01.720 --> 01:08.300
(Yet rampant corruption across every tier stalled the excavation and ignited widespread peasant uprisings,)

01:08.440 --> 01:13.000
(infuriating the Emperor so deeply that the Prince of Ning remains confined to the palace to this day.)

01:16.480 --> 01:21.800
(Looking at the board, the game has reached its finale. A single move will seal victory.)

01:23.160 --> 01:24.400
Your move.
